{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minute Man is a 2D beat 'em up platformer game where you can freeze time as you're fighting enemies to secure an advantage. Fight through various waves of enemies and defeat bosses in several levels, keeping time frozen as you chain combos against your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/53b204277316833c12a02b07aff60e3f.avif?t=1762542770\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight seven different clans, each containing waves of enemies and a boss you must defeat. Each clan has a unique method of combat, so be prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/c64aec5a28a4616c35679f77c0f167d8.avif?t=1762542770\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze time as you fight your enemies, using the time to secure an advantage. Time stays frozen longer as you land hits on your enemies, so be sure to stay on the attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670900?t=1762542770","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670900?t=1762542770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/a7a1a74aebed630373f28dc3de268f1a1ef9df12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762542770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/a7a1a74aebed630373f28dc3de268f1a1ef9df12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762542770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3685150,"description":""}]